  <Itf Name="INodeControl" Id="{0fb91335-6250-4bfd-a71c-b8b1796b8d19}">
    <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary

This interface provides a fluent way to access the global control signals (stopRequests, overrides, step requests).

