      </Get>
    </Property>
    <Property Name="stopRequest" Id="{de332b54-7833-4905-b16a-140831aeb624}">
      <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary

This property represents the stop request signal which either the operator triggers from the HMI or which is set by an error.

